---
import ContactForm from './ContactForm.astro';
import { waLink, waSections, CONTACT_EMAIL, CALENDLY_LINK } from '../config/site';

const wa = waSections.contacto;
---
<section
  id="contacto"
  class="relative isolate overflow-hidden py-24 md:py-36"
  data-wa-label={wa.label}
  data-wa-message={wa.message}
>
  <!-- Foco de luz de fondo claroscuro -->
  <div class="spotlight absolute inset-0 -z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto w-[min(1240px,calc(100%-2.5rem))]">
    
    <!-- Encabezado de la sección -->
    <div class="mb-14 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-mute font-medium">
        Atención Global · Colombia, EE.UU. & Internacional
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.4rem,5.5vw,4.8rem)] leading-[1.02] text-light max-sm:text-[2.2rem]">
        Hablemos de tu proyecto.<br />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-300 via-light to-rose-300 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          Cotiza en minutos.
        </span>
      </h2>

      <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base md:text-lg text-mute">
        Elige el canal que te sea más cómodo: completa el formulario express en 30 segundos, escríbenos por WhatsApp para respuesta inmediata o coordina una videollamada.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid de Contacto Internacional: Canales Directos (izq) + Formulario Express (der) -->
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-start">
      
      <!-- Columna Izquierda (5 cols): Canales Directos & Compromisos -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 lg:col-span-5">
        
        <!-- Canal 1: WhatsApp Business (Inmediatez para Latinoamérica) -->
        <a
          href={waLink(wa.message)}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="glass group relative flex items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-violet/40 hover:bg-white/[0.04] max-md:active:scale-[0.98]"
          data-magnetic="0.2"
        >
          <div class="grid size-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/30 group-hover:bg-emerald-500/20 transition-colors">
            <svg class="size-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M12.04 2C6.58 2 2.13 6.45 2.13 11.91C2.13 13.66 2.59 15.36 3.45 16.86L2.05 22L7.3 20.62C8.75 21.41 10.38 21.83 12.04 21.83C17.5 21.83 21.95 17.38 21.95 11.92C21.95 9.27 20.92 6.78 19.05 4.91C17.18 3.03 14.69 2 12.04 2M12.05 3.67C14.25 3.67 16.31 4.53 17.87 6.09C19.42 7.65 20.28 9.72 20.28 11.92C20.28 16.46 16.58 20.15 12.04 20.15C10.56 20.15 9.11 19.76 7.85 19.01L7.55 18.83L4.43 19.65L5.26 16.61L5.06 16.29C4.24 14.99 3.81 13.47 3.81 11.91C3.81 7.37 7.5 3.67 12.05 3.67M9.53 7.04C9.36 7.04 9.09 7.1 8.87 7.34C8.65 7.58 8.02 8.17 8.02 9.38C8.02 10.59 8.9 11.76 9.02 11.93C9.15 12.1 10.74 14.55 13.18 15.61C13.76 15.86 14.21 16.01 14.57 16.12C15.15 16.31 15.69 16.28 16.11 16.22C16.58 16.15 17.55 15.63 17.75 15.06C17.96 14.5 17.96 14.01 17.89 13.91C17.83 13.81 17.65 13.75 17.39 13.62C17.13 13.49 15.83 12.85 15.59 12.76C15.35 12.68 15.17 12.63 15 12.89C14.83 13.15 14.35 13.71 14.2 13.88C14.06 14.06 13.91 14.08 13.65 13.95C13.39 13.82 12.56 13.55 11.57 12.67C10.8 11.98 10.28 11.13 10.13 10.87C9.98 10.61 10.11 10.47 10.24 10.34C10.36 10.23 10.5 10.04 10.63 9.89C10.76 9.74 10.81 9.63 10.89 9.46C10.98 9.29 10.94 9.14 10.87 9.01C10.81 8.88 10.28 7.59 10.06 7.07C9.85 6.56 9.63 6.63 9.47 6.62L9.53 7.04Z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-light text-base group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors">WhatsApp Business</h3>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.68rem] font-medium text-emerald-400">En minutos</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-mute leading-relaxed">
              Ideal para Colombia y Latinoamérica. Te asesoramos directamente sobre alcance y costos.
            </p>
            <span class="mt-2.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-light group-hover:text-emerald-300">
              Escribir a +57 314 771 4202 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Canal 2: Correo Corporativo Directo -->
        <a
          href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}
          class="glass group relative flex items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-violet/40 hover:bg-white/[0.04] max-md:active:scale-[0.98]"
          data-magnetic="0.2"
        >
          <div class="grid size-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-violet/10 text-violet-300 ring-1 ring-violet/30 group-hover:bg-violet/20 transition-colors">
            <svg class="size-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07-1.916V6.75" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-light text-base group-hover:text-violet-300 transition-colors">Correo Corporativo</h3>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-white/5 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.68rem] text-mute">Global</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-mute leading-relaxed">
              Para RFP, requerimientos formales o clientes de EE.UU. y Europa.
            </p>
            <span class="mt-2.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono font-medium text-violet-300 group-hover:text-light transition-colors">
              {CONTACT_EMAIL} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Canal 3: Videollamada de 15 Minutos (Cal.com / Google Meet) -->
        <a
          href={CALENDLY_LINK}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="glass group relative flex items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-violet/40 hover:bg-white/[0.04] max-md:active:scale-[0.98]"
          data-magnetic="0.2"
        >
          <div class="grid size-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-300 ring-1 ring-rose-500/30 group-hover:bg-rose-500/20 transition-colors">
            <svg class="size-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 9v7.5" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-light text-base group-hover:text-rose-300 transition-colors">Videollamada de 15 min</h3>
              <span class="rounded-full bg-rose-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.68rem] text-rose-300 font-medium">Google Meet / Zoom</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-mute leading-relaxed">
              Conversa directamente con los fundadores para alinear alcance, viabilidad y presupuesto.
            </p>
            <span class="mt-2.5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-light group-hover:text-rose-300">
              Agendar llamada en línea <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <!-- Bloque de Confianza Internacional -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-carbon-2/60 p-5 backdrop-blur-md">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-light/80 mb-3">Compromisos Rembrandt Studio</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-mute">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-400"></span>
              <span><strong>Entrega de 4 a 6 días:</strong> Garantía estricta en planes express (rápido y perfecto).</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-400"></span>
              <span><strong>Pagos Globales:</strong> Facturación en USD o COP vía Stripe y tarjetas.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-400"></span>
              <span><strong>Propiedad Total:</strong> Código abierto, sin letras chicas ni dependencias.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Columna Derecha (7 cols): Formulario Express Integrado -->
      <div class="glass relative rounded-[2rem] p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10 lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="mb-6">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-mute font-medium mb-3">
            Formulario Directo
          </p>
          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl text-light sm:text-3xl">Envía los detalles de tu web</h3>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-mute">
            Te responderemos con una propuesta comercial completa y cotización en menos de 2 horas.
          </p>
        </div>
        <ContactForm />
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
